rame` instead of `ListConversationsMessage`/`ConversationListMessage`/`ConversationSummary`). Furthermore, it directly violates several explicit requirements in the issue: it omits the `transport.history?: {enabled: boolean}` opt-in config (exposing history unconditionally), returns an empty list (`sessions: []`) instead of `ErrorCodes.UNSUPPORTED` when `listFor` is missing, allows `limit: 0` and unbounded limits > 200 in validation instead of enforcing 1–200, and fails to update `example/full-config.ts` and `docs/getting-started.md`. It also logs raw store error messages (`error.message`) and omits `StoreCannotList`, startup warnings, and per-socket read serialization.","model":"gemini-4-argon"},"final_head_sha":"877b52e03bf890d5630cdea8d2bbd7f30e8a4a20","started_at":"2026-10-22T06:08:19.098Z","finished_at":"2026-10-22T06:41:21.619Z"}
